### 1. Đăng ký hợp lệ
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "player_one",
  "email": "Player.One@Example.com",
  "password": "Secret123",
  "displayName": "Người chơi 1"
}

### 2. Trùng username (đổi email)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "PLAYER_ONE",
  "email": "other@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### 3. Trùng email (đổi username)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "player_two",
  "email": "player.one@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}

### 4. Dữ liệu sai (nhiều lỗi cùng lúc)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "a b",
  "email": "khong-phai-email",
  "password": "123"
}

